"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Blood of unknown origin not only covers the floor,⟪k:2⟫but also streams down the walls "
"and drips from the ceiling."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Du sang d’origine inconnue non seulement recouvre le sol,⟪k:2⟫mais dégoutte aussi des "
"murs et du plafond."

#: search2:search2_C0DC5FF1_0C16_4E74_9924_A253D589E779
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2742fe847b385cbce3ff0abae4c3734e1638d2cb7863d04dbd9017358de6907d
